ml-service/saved_models_*/
saved_models_*/

# Model Binaries Note:
# The baseline models in ml-service/saved_models/ (~18MB total) are tracked so the
# application can be cloned and run immediately without retraining.
# If you prefer to exclude all serialized .joblib models, uncomment the lines below:
# ml-service/saved_models/*.joblib
# !ml-service/saved_models/metrics.json

